{"id":"CVE-2021-3733","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2022-03-07T00:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-10-14T09:49:49.275Z","description":"There's a flaw in urllib's AbstractBasicAuthHandler class. An attacker who controls a malicious HTTP server that an HTTP client (such as web browser) connects to, could trigger a Regular Expression Denial of Service (ReDOS) during an authentication request with a specially crafted payload that is sent by the server to the client. The greatest threat that this flaw poses is to application availability.","cwe":["CWE-400 CWE-400 - Uncontrolled Resource Consumption"],"metrics":[{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"none","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"partial"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"python","versions":["affected Fixed in python v3.6.14, python v3.7.11, python v3.8.10, python v3.9.5."]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.0 <V3.1.5 (custom)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518F-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.0 <V3.1.5 (custom)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIPLUS S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.0 <V3.1.5 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://bugs.python.org/issue43075"},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1995234"},{"url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/24391"},{"url":"https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2021-3733"},{"url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/7215d1ae25525c92b026166f9d5cac85fb"},{"url":"https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20220407-0001/"},{"url":"https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2023/05/msg00024.html","tags":["mailing-list"],"name":"[debian-lts-announce] 20230524 [SECURITY] [DLA 3432-1] python2.7 security update"},{"url":"https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2023/06/msg00039.html","tags":["mailing-list"],"name":"[debian-lts