{"id":"CVE-2021-3737","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2022-03-04T00:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-10-14T09:49:50.701Z","description":"A flaw was found in python. An improperly handled HTTP response in the HTTP client code of python may allow a remote attacker, who controls the HTTP server, to make the client script enter an infinite loop, consuming CPU time. The highest threat from this vulnerability is to system availability.","cwe":["CWE-835 CWE-835 - Loop with Unreachable Exit Condition ('Infinite Loop'), CWE-400 - Uncontrolled Resource Consumption"],"metrics":[{"src":"CISA-ADP","v":"3.1","score":7.5,"sev":"HIGH","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"none","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"partial"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"python","versions":["affected Fixed in python v3.6.14, python v3.7.11, python v3.8.11, python v3.9.6, python v3.10.0b2"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.0 <V3.1.5 (custom)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518F-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.0 <V3.1.5 (custom)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIPLUS S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.0 <V3.1.5 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://bugs.python.org/issue44022"},{"url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/25916"},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1995162"},{"url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/26503"},{"url":"https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2021-3737"},{"url":"https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujul2022.html"},{"url":"https://python-security.readthedocs.io/vuln/urllib-100-continue-loop.html"},{"url":"https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20220407-0009/"},{"url":"https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2023/05/msg00024.html","tags":["mailing-list"],"name":